OL,3,GNEWSARural crime 'out of control', says
OL,4,Afarmer                                 
OL,6,FA farmer has said rural crime is "out  
OL,7,Fof control" after suspected hare       
OL,8,Fcoursers damaged one of his fields.    
OL,10,FAndrew Ward, an arable farmer in       
OL,11,FLeadenham near Sleaford, said his land 
OL,12,Fhad been damaged by people driving     
OL,13,Ffour-wheel-drive vehicles at night in  
OL,14,Fpursuit of hares and deer.             
OL,16,FWard said: "They've done donuts in the 
OL,17,Fmiddle of the fields... the ruts are   
OL,18,Fprobably up to 9in deep."              
