OL,3,GNEWSARural crime 'out of control', says
OL,4,Afarmer                                 
OL,6,FSupt Phil Vickers of Lincolnshire      
OL,7,FPolice said: "While there is always    
OL,8,Fmore to do in tackling the scourge of  
OL,9,Fthis criminality, our dedicated team   
OL,10,Fwill continue to work with our         
OL,11,Fcommunities to both prevent crime and  
OL,12,Farrest those who bring harm."          
